    "Scan of the 1954 edition of the Hooven, Ohio, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1940; aerial photographs from 1949; field checked in 1954; last revised in 1954; printed in 1965.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22.1 x 27 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
